protein: none
servings: 2
cook time: 10 minutes
prep time: 5 minutes
time required: 15 minutes
alternative_name: Cacio e Pepe Recipe
ingredient_count: 4
---

Fill a large #pot with water and bring to a boil over high heat.

Add a small handful of @salt and @dried bucatini{8%oz} to boiling water.

Cook pasta, stirring occasionally until al dente, ~{6-8%minutes}.

Drain pasta, reserving 2/3 cup pasta water.

Pour pasta back into #pot or into a large #skillet and place over low heat.

Add pasta water and @unsalted butter{2%tbsp} and toss together until butter just melts.

Add @Pecorino Romano{1/2%cup}(freshly grated) and @cracked black pepper{1/2%tsp}(toasted) and continue to toss together until cheese melts and a creamy sauce forms.

Top with more grated cheese and serve.